    cardTitle: 'Jackpots: Types, Odds and RTP', cardDesc: 'How progressive pools grow, why a huge meter does not mean an imminent win, and how to calculate a series of chances.', cardTags: ['Jackpots', 'Probability · RTP'], cardLink: 'Read the article →', cardDate: 'Published: September 24, 2026', footer: 'Educational content about the mathematics of game mechanics.'
